{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 48, "ref": "judges 9:48", "book": "judges", "lang": "ms", "chapter": 9, "translation": "Lalu naiklah Avimelekh ke gunung Tsalmon, dia dan seluruh rakyat yang ⟨⟨את⟩ bersamanya⟩; dan Avimelekh mengambil ⟨את⟩ kapak-kapak itu di tangannya, lalu memotong dahan kayu, mengangkatnya dan meletakkannya di atas bahunya, dan berkatalah ia kepada rakyat yang bersamanya: \"Apa yang kamu lihat aku lakukan — cepatlah, lakukanlah seperti aku.\"", "tokens": [{"surface": "ויעל", "gloss": "Lalu naiklah"}, {"surface": "אבימלך", "gloss": "Avimelekh"}, {"surface": "הר", "gloss": "ke gunung"}, {"surface": "צלמון", "gloss": "Tsalmon"}, {"surface": "הוא", "gloss": "dia"}, {"surface": "וכל", "gloss": "dan seluruh"}, {"surface": "העם", "gloss": "rakyat"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "yang"}, {"surface": "אתו", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ bersamanya"}, {"surface": "ויקח", "gloss": "dan ... mengambil"}, {"surface": "אבימלך", "gloss": "Avimelekh"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "kapak-kapak itu"}, {"surface": "הקרדמות", "gloss": "kapak-kapak itu"}, {"surface": "בידו", "gloss": "di tangannya"}, {"surface": "ויכרת", "gloss": "lalu memotong"}, {"surface": "שוכת", "gloss": "dahan"}, {"surface": "עצים", "gloss": "kayu"}, {"surface": "וישאה", "gloss": "mengangkatnya"}, {"surface": "וישם", "gloss": "dan meletakkannya"}, {"surface": "על", "gloss": "di atas"}, {"surface": "שכמו", "gloss": "bahunya"}, {"surface": "ויאמר", "gloss": "dan berkatalah"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "kepada"}, {"surface": "העם", "gloss": "rakyat"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "yang"}, {"surface": "עמו", "gloss": "bersamanya"}, {"surface": "מה", "gloss": "Apa"}, {"surface": "ראיתם", "gloss": "kamu lihat"}, {"surface": "עשיתי", "gloss": "aku lakukan"}, {"surface": "מהרו", "gloss": "cepatlah"}, {"surface": "עשו", "gloss": "lakukanlah"}, {"surface": "כמוני", "gloss": "seperti aku"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-04T12:08:02.680513076Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}